==Description==
'''Narrator Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 34 on the premium track or reaching Level 39 on the regular track. It had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|1,215}} or {{Robux|143}} ({{Robux|114}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock on the premium track, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|18,720}} or {{Robux|3,570}} ({{Robux|2,842}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale), while it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|1,450}} or {{Robux|173}} ({{Robux|138}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock on the regular track, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|25,505}} or {{Robux|4,400}} ({{Robux|3,504}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Narrator Charm''' showcases the [[Narrator (Enemy)|Narrator]] posing on a stage with two lights. It plays the default charm placement sound.

The color of the '''Narrator Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is red in its preview in the inventory.

